  "details": "- CVE-2026-11940: validate the hardlink-extraction fallback target against the\n  name the link is recreated at in tarfile's makelink_with_filter(), so a\n  crafted archive can no longer smuggle a symlink stored at a deeper name out\n  of the destination directory, and route the extraction filter through\n  TarFile.extract() so single-member extraction is covered by that check and\n  not only extractall()",
